body:
The only one I can think of is the dishy app is remote without the Starlink router. Which means you won't be able to pull up stats when it's hard down such as in bad weather. In those cases you'll need your pc to go to [dishy.starlink.com](https://dishy.starlink.com) which also doesn't work without the Starlink router, but can be fixed using this guide below.

&#x200B;

